# Dreamachine needs no environment variables.
#
# This file previously held VAULT_LOG_PATH, a bridge to a log inside Ben's
# planning vault. That pattern is retired — the running log now lives at
# log.md in this repo and the vault reads it directly.
#
# The app is a static export with no backend, no database, and no network
# calls after initial load, so there is nothing to configure here.
